WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.792 --> 00:00:28.027
"Zippy is mean," Eddy thought.

2
00:00:28.028 --> 00:00:37.406
He drove away from Zippy.

3
00:00:37.407 --> 00:00:42.809
Eddy watched the busy spaceport.

4
00:00:42.810 --> 00:00:52.627
A fuel truck drove by.

5
00:00:52.628 --> 00:01:00.730
"I'm bringing fuel to Rocky!"

6
00:01:00.731 --> 00:01:09.540
"Let's meet Rocky," Ms. Fender said.

7
00:01:09.541 --> 00:01:16.576
They drove over to the rocket.

8
00:01:16.577 --> 00:01:20.394
Eddy blinked.

9
00:01:20.395 --> 00:01:24.995
Rocky was huge!

10
00:01:24.996 --> 00:01:28.065
"Hi, kids!" Rocky said.

11
00:01:28.066 --> 00:01:31.595
"Will you watch me blast off?"

12
00:01:31.596 --> 00:01:36.978
"Yes!" everyone yelled.

13
00:01:36.979 --> 00:01:42.400
"My job is important," Rocky said.

14
00:01:42.401 --> 00:01:46.156
"I'm bringing things to space."

15
00:01:46.157 --> 00:01:49.791
"How will you do that?" Jeb asked.

16
00:01:49.792 --> 00:01:58.505
"My engine is strong," Rocky said.

17
00:01:58.506 --> 00:02:02.550
"I can fly very fast."

18
00:02:02.551 --> 00:02:05.948
"I'm fast too," Zippy said.

19
00:02:05.949 --> 00:02:08.656
"Watch this!"

20
00:02:08.657 --> 00:02:11.062
Zippy sped off.

21
00:02:11.063 --> 00:02:12.244
Zoom!

22
00:02:12.245 --> 00:02:21.945
He shot across the spaceport.

23
00:02:21.946 --> 00:02:24.889
"Uh-oh," Eddy said.

24
00:02:24.890 --> 00:02:28.764
"Zippy is breaking the rules."

25
00:02:28.765 --> 00:02:32.487
Ms. Fender beeped her horn.

26
00:02:32.488 --> 00:02:37.876
"No speeding, Zippy!"
